id: zaf_nvm_soc
label: ZAF NVM SOC Component
category: Z-Wave|ZAF|NVM
description: >
  This component implements the non-volatile memory (NVM) handling, which is needed by SoC applications. This type
  of memory can preserve the stored information even in EM4 (the lowest power energy mode) or in
  case of shutdown. This component also provides API for default configuration.

package: zwave
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: zw_sbom_license

include:
- path: "ZAF/ApplicationUtilities/nvm"
  file_list:
  - path: "zaf_nvm_soc.h"
source:
- path: "ZAF/ApplicationUtilities/nvm/zaf_nvm_soc.c"
provides:
- name: zaf_nvm_soc
root_path: zwave
